#  Line Follower Robot

An Arduino-based **Line Follower Robot** that uses IR sensors to detect the track and an **L298N motor driver** to control the motors.

##  Components

* Arduino Uno
* IR Sensors
* L298N Motor Driver
* DC Motors
* Battery

##  Working

The IR sensors detect the line and send signals to the Arduino. Based on the sensor readings, Arduino controls the motors to keep the robot moving along the track.

##  Features

* Automatic line following
* Simple and efficient design
* Arduino controlled
* Easy to build and modify
